<title>UK: Invesco appoints new vice-president.</title>
<headline>Invesco appoints new vice-president.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment management group Invesco Plc said A.D. Frazier Jr would become executive vice-president with effect from November 1.</p>
<p>Frazier was formerly senior executive vice-president and chief operating officer of the Atlanta Committee for the Olympic Games, a statement from Invesco said.</p>
<p>He will also join the management committee and the board of directors, Invesco said.</p>
<p>Frazier will be involved in client relationships within Invesco's institutional area as well as international accounts.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
